The tasks were incremental and not separate. Task 1 involved gathering data from  DHS. The data was AEBAS - adhaar enabled attendance system
Task 2 involved linking the data in task 1 with the data feom the treasury. Here we mapped attendanceID (emp_id from AEBAS) with emp_code from treasury
Task 3 involved linking data from next-gen e-hospital to the data from task1 and task2 combined. This was the most difficult task as there was no possible way to run a script and link them. This was because nextgen e-hospital follows a modular development approach. The project is maintained and developed by NIC so each module is developed by a different NIC - so different backends but same frontend framework.
